{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0.0",
  "id": "infrastructure-alerting-create-contact-point-prereq",
  "title": "Create a contact point",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "A contact point is where Grafana sends notifications when an alert fires. Create one now so it's ready when you configure your alert rule."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "To create a contact point, complete the following steps:"
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "requirements": ["navmenu-open"],
          "reftarget": "a[data-testid='data-testid Nav menu item'][href='/alerting']",
          "content": "In the left-hand navigation menu, click **Alerting** under **Alerts & IRM**."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "a[href='/alerting/notifications']",
          "content": "Click **Notification configuration** to open the contact points page."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "a[aria-label='add contact point']",
          "content": "Click **+ Add contact point**."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "input[id='name']",
          "targetvalue": "email-alerts",
          "content": "Enter a name for your contact point, for example **email-alerts**."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "input[id='contact-point-type-items.0.']",
          "targetvalue": "Email",
          "content": "Select **Email** as the integration type."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "textarea[id='items.0.settings.addresses']",
          "targetvalue": "your@email.com",
          "content": "Enter your email address."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "button[type='submit']",
          "content": "Click **Save contact point**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Your contact point is ready. You'll select it when configuring notifications in your alert rule."
    }
  ]
}
